# Copy to `.env` in the repo root (`.env` is gitignored).
# ThesisTester loads only THESISTESTER_STORE_DIR from this file, and never
# overrides a value already set in the process environment.
#
# Recommended local Windows store (repo at C:\dev\ThesisTester):
# Uncomment the next line on Windows, or run: .\scripts\set_store_dir.ps1 -UserEnv
# THESISTESTER_STORE_DIR=C:\dev\ThesisTester\.thesistester_store
#
# On Linux/macOS, use an absolute POSIX path if you want an explicit store:
# THESISTESTER_STORE_DIR=/absolute/path/to/.thesistester_store
